{{Quote|We weren't prepared for anything like this.|Ushos O. Statura, on Resistance casualties during the assault on Starkiller Base|<ref name="Star Wars: The Force Awakens (novelization)">[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens (novelization)|''Star Wars: The Force Awakens'' novelization]]</ref>}}
'''Ushos O. Statura''' was a [[human]] [[Gender|male]] [[admiral]] and senior [[Resistance officer|officer]] with the [[Resistance]]. Statura [[Homeworld|hailed]] from the [[planet]] [[Garel]] and had a scientific background. Statura's knowledge aided in the Resistance's efforts during their [[Cold War|conflict]] with the [[First Order]], in which he helped plan the [[Battle of Starkiller Base|assault]] on [[Starkiller Base]], the First Order's [[superweapon]], from their [[Resistance base|command center]] on [[D'Qar]]. Statura correctly predicted the attack on Starkiller Base would be successful if the Resistance crippled its [[thermal oscillator]], which led to the destruction of the superweapon.

==Biography==
===Galactic Civil War===
Ushos<ref name="TROS VD">''[[Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> O. Statura<ref name="Flightlog">''[[Poe Dameron: Flight Log]]''</ref> was [[Reproduction|born]] on [[Garel]] sometime prior to the [[Galactic Civil War]]. By the [[time]] he was a teenager, he had [[Liberation of Garel|fought]] against the [[Galactic Empire]] to liberate his [[homeworld]]. Following the [[Battle of Endor]], he pursued a career in applied sciences.<ref name="TVD" />

===War against the First Order===
Eventually, Statura was recruited by [[General]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa]] as [[commander]] of [[Starship|ship]] procurement and logistics for her [[Resistance]] forces,<ref name="TVD" /> becoming an [[admiral]].<ref name="VII" /> He was never far from Organa's side, as she relied upon Statura for advice and perspective.<ref name="TVD" /> He awarded the [[Rieekan Ribbon for Bravery in Battle]] to [[Poe Dameron]] for his role in the [[rescue of Admiral Ackbar]].<ref name="Flightlog" /> After the [[Hosnian Cataclysm|destruction]] of the [[Hosnian system]], he helped plan the [[Battle of Starkiller Base|assault]] on [[Starkiller Base]].<ref name="VII" />

In the aftermath, as the First Order regrouped and prepared to obliterate the Resistance base on D'Qar, Statura was part of the briefing and expressed shock that the regime could arrive so quickly.<ref name="Poe 28">[[Poe Dameron 28|''Poe Dameron'' 28]]</ref> Statura was killed along with most of High Command during the [[Battle of Oetchi]] when the Resistance [[flagship]] [[Raddus (MC85 Star Cruiser)|''Raddus'']] was attacked by the First Order.<ref name="Encyclopedia" />

===Legacy===
{{Quote|Not everyone. But the Resistance leadership is gone. Admiral Holdo, Ackbar, Statura. The entire fleet.|Temmin Wexley informing Norra Wexley of Statura's fate|<ref name="Resistance Reborn">''[[Resistance Reborn]]''</ref>}}
Sometime after the [[Battle of Crait]], [[Temmin Wexley]] and [[Karé Kun]] went to meet the retired [[Wedge Antilles]] and [[Norra Wexley]], whom they informed of Statura's death alongside other members of the Resistance leadership, including Admiral [[Gial Ackbar]] and [[Vice Admiral]] [[Amilyn Holdo]].<ref name="Resistance Reborn" />

==Behind the scenes==
Ushos O. Statura was portrayed by [[Ken Leung]] in the [[2015]] film [[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens|''Star Wars'': Episode VII ''The Force Awakens'']], the first installment of the ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[sequel trilogy]].<ref name="VII" /> Leung previously played [[Wikipedia:Miles Straume|Miles Straume]] on the television series [[Wikipedia:Lost (TV series)|''Lost'']], which was produced by [[J.J. Abrams]], who directed, produced, and co-wrote ''The Force Awakens''.<ref>Yamato, Jen. (December 19, 2015). [http://www.thedailybeast.com/articles/2015/12/19/how-to-spot-all-the-star-wars-the-force-awakens-cameos-from-daniel-craig-to-radiohead.html "How to Spot All the 'Star Wars: The Force Awakens' Cameos, From Daniel Craig to Yoda"]. [[Wikipedia:The Daily Beast|The Daily Beast]].</ref>

